      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1795530902170,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• Validate configuration via Model Registry.\n• Request a final quote from Pricing.\n• Store the accepted quote with the job.\n• Reserve its amount through Billing.\n• Execute asynchronously via Runware.\n• Success: capture; failure: release.\n\nOwn data: jobs, inputs, status, provider task,\naccepted quote snapshot, reservation reference.",
      "originalText": "• Validate configuration via Model Registry.\n• Request a final quote from Pricing.\n• Store the accepted quote with the job.\n• Reserve its amount through Billing.\n• Execute asynchronously via Runware.\n• Success: capture; failure: release.\n\nOwn data: jobs, inputs, status, provider task,\naccepted quote snapshot, reservation reference.",
      "fontSize": 24,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
