      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1795530902170,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• Models, capabilities, parameters and constraints.\n• Resolution, duration, aspect ratio, input/output types.\n• Provider mappings, Runware IDs and configuration.\n• Provider availability and provider costs/rates.\n• Synchronize metadata and costs from Runware.\n\nPublic API: validateConfiguration, getModelOffering\nOwn data: models, capabilities, offerings, cost versions.",
      "originalText": "• Models, capabilities, parameters and constraints.\n• Resolution, duration, aspect ratio, input/output types.\n• Provider mappings, Runware IDs and configuration.\n• Provider availability and provider costs/rates.\n• Synchronize metadata and costs from Runware.\n\nPublic API: validateConfiguration, getModelOffering\nOwn data: models, capabilities, offerings, cost versions.",
