      "text": "• Selling rules, markups and profit margins.\n• Calculate final quotes using Model Registry data.\n• Discounts, promotions and future pricing policies.\n\nPublic API: createGenerationQuote\nOwn data: pricing policies, rule versions, quotes.",
      "originalText": "• Selling rules, markups and profit margins.\n• Calculate final quotes using Model Registry data.\n• Discounts, promotions and future pricing policies.\n\nPublic API: createGenerationQuote\nOwn data: pricing policies, rule versions, quotes.",
