      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• Balances/credits, purchases and transactions.\n• Reserve, capture, release, refund.\n• Payment integration and financial history.\n• Receives an amount; no model or pricing knowledge.\n\nPublic API: reserve, capture, release, refund\nOwn data: balances, reservations, ledger, payments.\nNo dependencies on Pricing or Model Registry.",
      "originalText": "• Balances/credits, purchases and transactions.\n• Reserve, capture, release, refund.\n• Payment integration and financial history.\n• Receives an amount; no model or pricing knowledge.\n\nPublic API: reserve, capture, release, refund\nOwn data: balances, reservations, ledger, payments.\nNo dependencies on Pricing or Model Registry.",
