      "versionNonce": 1860119158,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1795530902170,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Postgres: module-owned tables/schemas; only the owning repository reads or writes them.\nCross-module calls use public internal APIs, never another module’s tables.\nRedis: cache Model Registry reads; TTL and invalidation on synchronization. Object storage: accessed through Media.",
      "originalText": "Postgres: module-owned tables/schemas; only the owning repository reads or writes them.\nCross-module calls use public internal APIs, never another module’s tables.\nRedis: cache Model Registry reads; TTL and invalidation on synchronization. Object storage: accessed through Media.",
      "fontSize": 24,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
