      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• Validate model/configuration via Model Registry.\n• Get Pricing quote; persist accepted quote snapshot.\n• Reserve amount via Billing; execute via Runware.\n• Success: capture. Failure: release. Never reprice jobs.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• Validate model/configuration via Model Registry.\n• Get Pricing quote; persist accepted quote snapshot.\n• Reserve amount via Billing; execute via Runware.\n• Success: capture. Failure: release. Never reprice jobs.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
